* Fully responsive **BR Architects Website** designed for mobile, tablet, and desktop devices.
* Mobile-friendly navigation bar with a hamburger menu.
* Responsive hero section featuring the BR Architects banner image.
* Project showcase section adapts smoothly to different screen sizes.
* High-quality images that scale properly without distortion.
* Clean and modern user interface inspired by architectural websites.
* CSS Media Queries used for responsiveness across devices.
* Improved readability and user experience on small screens.
* Fast and accessible design with organized content layout.
* Cross-browser compatibility for consistent performance.

